==Trivia==
*[[Bears Be Back]] have the most references of all characters, with six total.
*Excluding mythologies and religions, the most referenced work or franchise in the game is ''Monster Hunter'', with 27 known references, most of them being related to the [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] type as seen [[Pop Culture References/Video Games|here]].

